SiF's Express Engines | Official Trailer
Ⓘ This video is intended for GENERAL AUDIENCES and can be enjoyed by adults.

Hi everyone! I am so hyped to show the first official trailer for my next project 'Express Engines'! This project is going to be my biggest one yet and it's going to so exciting. From this video you'll be able to notice that each character is going to have their own voice actor! I'm super pumped about being able to work with VA's again because they bring these projects to life. Enjoy!!

Please note that the first episode of Express Engines does not have a release date! As well, not everything in this trailer is final!!

